CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.1
-------------------------

BUG FIXES AND CLEANUP

    * Updated test runner script to natively support testthat engine framework.
    * Formally declared BiocGenerics package dependency in metadata imports list.
    * Adjusted C++ attribute namespace documentation import formatting attributes.

CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.0
-------------------------

NEW FEATURES

    * Initial release of spatialDESeq.
    * Added rcpp_spatial_weights C++ engine for fast physical tissue coordinate weight mapping.
    * Implemented parallelized spatial GLM framework with library-size normalization offset vectors.
    * Added plotSpatialDESeq, plotVolcano, and runExplorer interactive dashboard.
